sequenceDiagram
  participant O as Operator
  participant R as Runtime history authority
  participant A as Agent provider
  participant UI as Fresh Observatory
  O->>R: authenticated operator turn
  R->>R: retain ordered operator entry
  R->>A: governed inference
  A-->>R: generated reply
  R->>R: retain ordered agent entry
  R-->>O: ingress.completed telemetry
  UI->>R: authenticated bounded history request
  R-->>UI: conversation_history.v1 (operator + agent)
  UI->>UI: restore and deduplicate by stable entry identity
